{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_01",
      "hash": "eaf7003cf3e9b4e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "櫃台「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_04",
      "hash": "eaf6fd3cf3e9afcb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我們公司這裡\\n現在遇上了點麻煩。\\c\\n……因為有些危險，\\n小孩子不可以進去喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_01",
      "hash": "26e576e0f08c51d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「別這麼說，\\n就讓我們參觀一下嘛？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_02",
      "hash": "eaf7033cf3e9b9fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "櫃台「哎呀，是青綠呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_01",
      "hash": "4c13e9c3c6b311d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n我找[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好久啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_07",
      "hash": "4c13e7c3c6b30e6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳怎麼會跑來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_01",
      "hash": "994bb0148a000904",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "因為火箭隊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_02",
      "hash": "994bb3148a000e1d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "聽說這裡被佔領……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_02",
      "hash": "4c13ecc3c6b316ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「果然是這樣！\\n火箭隊那些傢伙\\r\\n還真的是到處為非作歹！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_02",
      "hash": "26e573e0f08c4cb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「[VAR TRNAME(0001)]說的沒錯！\\c\\n我們不能再繼續\\n放任火箭隊胡作非為了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_03",
      "hash": "994bb2148a000c6a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我也這麼想！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_04",
      "hash": "994bad148a0003eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "該怎麼做呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_03",
      "hash": "26e574e0f08c4e6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「好！\\n我們趕快來開作戰會議吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_04",
      "hash": "26e579e0f08c56ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「首先就從我們\\n能做到的事開始做起！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_05",
      "hash": "26e57ae0f08c589d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……就這麼決定了。\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]就按照計畫\\n去把西爾佛公司裡的\\r\\n火箭隊趕出去。\\c\\n只有一個人太危險了，\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]也一起去吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_03",
      "hash": "4c13ebc3c6b3153a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「好的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_06",
      "hash": "26e577e0f08c5384",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「我的話就負責\\n搜索整個關都地區！\\c\\n一邊把遇上的每個\\n火箭隊的傢伙都解決掉，\\r\\n一邊想辦法找出\\r\\n火箭隊老大的藏身之處。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_11",
      "hash": "26e8fae0f08f67f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我也會去寶可夢聯盟一趟，\\n把這件事告訴大家。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_04",
      "hash": "4c13e6c3c6b30cbb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「太棒了！\\n也就是說我們也許能\\r\\n得到四天王的幫助……！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_07",
      "hash": "26e578e0f08c5537",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「那我們就兵分兩路，\\n開始我們的作戰行動吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_08",
      "hash": "26e56de0f08c4286",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……雖然我想這麼說，\\n但在這之前……"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_12",
      "hash": "26e8fde0f08f6d0d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]、[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\c\\n我不知道你們兩個\\n實力究竟如何。\\c\\n所以我得先見識一下你們的實力，\\n才能放心把事情交給你們！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_05",
      "hash": "4c13e5c3c6b30b08",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_09",
      "hash": "26e56ee0f08c4439",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「誰先上都行，\\n放馬過來吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_10",
      "hash": "26e8fbe0f08f69a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「喂喂！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要去哪裡？\\n我在這裡喔？"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_03",
      "hash": "eaf7023cf3e9b84a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "櫃台「你們是來拯救\\n西爾佛公司的嗎？\\c\\n既然是青綠的朋友，\\n應該是可以信賴的人吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_06",
      "hash": "4c13e8c3c6b31021",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「如果這次能打贏，\\n也許我就能有信心\\r\\n幫嘎啦嘎啦報仇了……！\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要先上嗎？"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0900_max",
      "hash": "d4af1fd88e867b70"
    }
  ]
}
